At 4mm width, it reads as a medium-width men's band — substantial enough to show the stone detail, narrow enough for standard daily wear. The 18K yellow gold format suits the step-cut stones: warm metal and architectural geometry read as vintage-modern.

The 1/8ct total weight is subtle. The diamonds accent the band rather than leading it — visible up close, but the step-cut detail is a surprise feature rather than the first thing you notice from a distance.

